msgid ""
"<acronym>MRML</acronym> stands for Multimedia Retrieval Markup Language. "
"<acronym>MRML</acronym> is an XML-based protocol to provide standardized access "
"to Multimedia retrieval software. See <ulink url=\"http://www.mrml.net\">"
"http://www.mrml.net</ulink> for more information."
